  "post_content": "<p>(17 fotos) Este jueves se han iniciado en el restaurant Toledo, en la calle Argelita, 20 de Onda, esquina avda. Montendre, las XVI Jornadas gastron&oacute;micas de la alcachofa. Se desarrollar&aacute;n de lunes a s&aacute;bado hasta el 9 de abril, en horario de comidas, pero tambi&eacute;n se puede encargar para servicio de cena.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2022/03/IMG_20220324_150119.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p><p>Por s&oacute;lo 36 euros iva incluido, con bodega aparte, se puede disfrutar de un aperitivo, un entrante, un primero, un segundo y un tercee plato y postre, incluso este &uacute;ltimo elaborado tambi&eacute;n con alcachofa. Las reservas se pueden realizar en los tel&eacute;fonos 964 77 09 10 o en el 964 60 09 72.</p><p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_145458.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_145458\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_145515.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_145515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_145532.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_145532\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_150119.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_150119\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_150150.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_150150\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_151316.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_151316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_151408.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_151408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_151423.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_151423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_152528.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_152528\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_152559.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_152559\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_152616.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_152616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_153631.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_153631\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_153715.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_153715\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_153726.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_153726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_154635.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_154635\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_154705.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_154705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadescarxofatoledo/IMG_20220324_154730.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20220324_154730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
